  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start, you need to identify the requirements for your trip."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If you choose \"Select one way\", you can proceed with the process. However, if you choose \"Select return\", you can also continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "After that, you will need to select the departure city and then the destination city."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "Once you have chosen the destination city, you can proceed to select the class."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "Once the class is selected, you can then choose your seat."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "After selecting your seat, you will be prompted to enter the type and number of passengers."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "Once you have entered this information, you can continue to the flight selection."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Finally, once you have completed the flight selection, the process will come to an end."
    }
